gene expression clusters. They moderately but significantly differ in overall survival. One cluster exhibits high expression of immune response genes (IR) and contains most of the HPV16 DNA+ RNA+ patients. The IR cluster and disruptive TP53 mutations are associated with lymph node metastasis independent of HPV16 status and we validate each of these associations in another large data set. Consistent with earlier studies, disruptive TP53 mutations are prognostically unfavorable. Our findings underscore the importance of measuring the HPV16 RNA (E6*I) and TP53-mutation status for patient stratification and for the first time identify associations of an immune response-related gene expression cluster and TP53 mutations with lymph node metastasis in HNSCC.","gpl":"10558","gse":"65858","taxon":"Homo sapiens","entrytype":"GSE","gdstype":"Expression profiling by array","ptechtype":"","valtype":"","ssinfo":"","subsetinfo":"","pdat":"2015/06/24","suppfile":"TXT","samples":[{"accession":"GSM1607745","title":"GW_068 Head and neck squamous cell carcinoma Illumina HT12v4"},{"accession":"GSM1607828","title":"GW_158 Head and neck squamous cell carcinoma Illumina HT12v4"},{"accession":"GSM1607708","title":"GW_028 Head and neck squamous cell carcinoma Illumina HT12v4"},{"accession":"GSM1607874","title":"GW_210 Head and neck squamous cell carcinoma Illumina HT12v4"},{"accession":"GSM1607791","title":"GW_119 Head and neck squamous cell carcinoma Illumina HT12v4"},{"accession":"GSM1607911","title":"GW_249 Head and neck squamous cell carcinoma Illumina HT12v4"},{"accession":"GSM1607811","title":"GW_141 Head and neck squamous cell carcinoma Illumina HT12v4"},{"accession":"GSM1607728","title":"GW_049 Head and neck squamous cell carcinoma Illumina HT12v4"},{"accession":"GSM1607894","title":"GW_231 Head and neck squamous cell carcinoma Illumina HT12v4"},{"accession":"GSM1607931","title":"GW_283 Head and neck squamous cell carcinoma Illumina HT12v4"},{"accession":"GSM1607765","title":"GW_088 